      "quote": "PubMed (20002015); Excerpta Medica Database (EMBASE) (2000-2015); OVID (2000-2015) and World PLOS Health Organization (WHO) library and Cochrane library.",
      "reason": "Database names and coverage dates (2000-2015) are given for PubMed, EMBASE and OVID, but no search interfaces/platforms are specified and Cochrane library and WHO library lack coverage dates."
