    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_7_e8",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_13",
      "quote": "Due to the diversity of interventions and health topics covered, populations, study types and outcomes, a multi-stage search strategy was developed to identify relevant publications.",
      "reason": "A multi-stage search strategy is mentioned, but the final conceptual structure and the explorations used to develop it are not described in detail (full strategy deferred to S1 Text, not retrieved)."
